          "type": "p",
          "text": "Business Analytics is decision-focused: statistics, analysis and communication for business questions, comfortable entirely in Excel if that's your team. Data Science goes further into building ML models in Python or R. Teams often run this first."
        },
        {
          "type": "summary",
          "text": "Can our team stay in Excel for the whole program?+"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Yes. Excel carries the full syllabus for most business teams; Python or R come in only if your team wants them. The statistics matter more than the tool."
        },
